'''Peep Eyes''' spawn in pairs and float diagonally around the room over obstacles, bouncing off of walls and other monsters and dealing contact damage to Isaac. They are completely invulnerable and can also block projectiles. The trajectory of the eyes can be deviated by bombs. They are only spawned by [[Peep]] as apart of his fight, one at 66% HP and a second at 33% HP and are destroyed once Peep is killed.

=== Notes ===
* Cyan champion Peep Eyes spawn detached from Peep at the beginning of the fight.
